      </TableRow>
      </TableHeader>
      <TableBody>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell><code>audience</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>string</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>audience is the intended audience of the token in "TokenRequestSpec". It will default to the audiences of kube apiserver.</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
